// Title: Suspicious NTLM Authentication on the Printer Spooler Service
// ID: bb76d96b-821c-47cf-944b-7ce377864492
// Status: test
// Level: high
// Author: Elastic (idea), Tobias Michalski (Nextron Systems)
// Date: 2022-05-04
// Tags: attack.privilege-escalation, attack.credential-access, attack.t1212
// Description: Detects a privilege elevation attempt by coercing NTLM authentication on the Printer Spooler service
// Converted by: Sigma Universal SIEM/EDR CLI

process where (((process.command_line like "*_C:\\windows\\system32\\davclnt.dll,DavSetCookie*" and process.command_line like "*_http*") and (process.command_line like "*_spoolss*" or process.command_line like "*_srvsvc*" or process.command_line like "*_/print/pipe/*")) and ((process.executable endswith "\\rundll32.exe") or (process.pe.original_file_name == "RUNDLL32.EXE")))
